Suddenly sounded roaring and a wolf with open muzzle appeared in front of you. That was a large beast, bigger than you. You looked into his eyes like being spellbound. It actually was a horrible sight: human eyes on the beast's muzzle with opened toothy mouth.

The beast jumped forward and you ran towards him. The predator skillfully parried attacks, and soon you understood that he was stronger and more experienced. If the battle would continue, you wouldn't probably make it out alive, let alone the winning.
When the time was right, you jumped in the nearest bush and ran away. It seemed that the opponent didn't pursue you. At least when you turned around, there was no one behind.